        <section>

            <h2>
                Remember
            </h2>

            <p>
                <strong>
                    Many AI tools offer limited free access.<br>
                    Frequent professional use may require payment.<br>
                    AI services cost money to operate.<br>
                    Check pricing and limits before subscribing.<br>
                    Pay only when the tool provides clear value.<br>
                    AI answers may differ between users.<br>
                    Models, interfaces, and features may change.<br>
                    Focus on the workflow, not one exact result.<br>
                    Always review and test generated code.<br>
                    Save receipts and monitor automatic renewal.<br>
                    The &lt;head&gt; contains webpage information.<br>
                    The &lt;body&gt; contains visible webpage content.<br>
                    The &lt;meta&gt; element provides metadata and does
                    not use a closing tag.<br>
                    The correct EGA logo path is
                    images/ega-logo.png.
                </strong>
            </p>

        </section>

